=📝 *New post draft* `{{ $('Build Row').first().json.post_id }}` · {{ $('Build Row').first().json.pillar }}{{ $('Plan').first().json.mode === 'redraft' ? ' (rewrite of a rejected post)' : '' }}
*Topic:* {{ $('Build Row').first().json.topic }}

{{ $('Build Row').first().json.draft }}

🖼 *Image:* {{ $('Build Row').first().json.image_brief }}
Drop it in <https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/YOUR_GOOGLE_ID-|Guardian Images> named `{{ $('Build Row').first().json.post_id }}.png`

✅ Approve: status = Approved in ContentQueue.  ❌ Reject: status = Rejected + your reason in your_feedback.

